#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:1
msgid "Edit Background"
msgstr "背景の編集"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:3
msgid ""
"This document describes how to customize a button's background, including "
"background images, borders, colors, and other parameters."
msgstr "このドキュメントでは、背景画像・枠線・色などのパラメータを含め、キーの背景をカスタマイズする方法を説明します。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:5
msgid "Interface Overview"
msgstr "画面の概要"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:7
msgid "![1742124250018](image/background/1742124250018.png)"
msgstr "![1742124250018](image/background/1742124250018.png)"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:7
msgid "1742124250018"
msgstr "1742124250018"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:9
#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:31
#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:47
msgid "The following features are available:"
msgstr "利用できる機能は次のとおりです。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:11
msgid "Background color selection"
msgstr "背景色の選択"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:12
msgid "Open an image file as background (supports jpg, png, and gif formats)"
msgstr "画像ファイルを背景として開く（jpg / png / gif に対応）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:13
msgid "Import image from clipboard as background"
msgstr "クリップボードの画像を背景として取り込む"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:14
msgid "Capture a portion of the screen as background"
msgstr "画面の一部を切り取って背景にする"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:15
msgid ""
"Current image filename with delete button to remove the background image"
msgstr "現在の画像ファイル名と、背景画像を削除するボタン"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:16
msgid ""
"Border style selection (supports single solid line, double solid line, "
"dotted line, and 3D styles)"
msgstr "枠線スタイルの選択（実線・二重線・点線・3D など）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:17
msgid "Border color selection"
msgstr "枠線の色の選択"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:18
msgid "Border width slider"
msgstr "枠線幅スライダー"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:19
msgid "Button width slider"
msgstr "キー幅のスライダー"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:20
msgid "Toggle button width slider step size (switches between 60px and 10px)"
msgstr "キー幅スライダーのステップを切り替える（60px と 10px）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:21
msgid ""
"Toggle maximum adjustable button width (switches between 600px and 2170px)"
msgstr "調整できるキー幅の上限を切り替える（600px と 2170px）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:22
msgid ""
"Imported background image gallery with delete buttons for individual images"
msgstr "取り込んだ背景画像のギャラリー（各画像を個別に削除可能）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:23
msgid "Delete all imported images"
msgstr "取り込んだ画像をすべて削除"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:25
msgid "Image Editing"
msgstr "画像編集"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:27
msgid "When importing a background image, you can crop the image"
msgstr "背景画像を取り込む際にトリミングできます"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:29
msgid "![1742136232365](image/background/1742136232365.png)"
msgstr "![1742136232365](image/background/1742136232365.png)"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:29
msgid "1742136232365"
msgstr "1742136232365"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:33
msgid ""
"Image cropping frame (dimensions match current button width, height is "
"fixed)"
msgstr "トリミング枠（幅は現在のキー幅に合わせ、高さは固定）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:34
msgid "Image zoom slider (mouse wheel can also be used for zooming)"
msgstr "画像のズーム用スライダー（マウスホイールでも操作可能）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:35
msgid "Auto-scale image to fit"
msgstr "画像に合わせて自動でスケール調整"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:36
msgid "Horizontal image flip"
msgstr "画像の水平反転"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:37
msgid "Vertical image flip"
msgstr "画像の垂直反転"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:38
msgid "Clockwise image rotation"
msgstr "画像を時計回りに回転"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:39
msgid ""
"Use original image without cropping or modifications (useful when your "
"prepared image matches the button dimensions exactly)"
msgstr "トリミングや加工をせず元画像のまま使う（キー寸法にぴったり合わせた画像を用意している場合に便利）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:40
msgid "Apply changes and import image"
msgstr "変更を適用して画像を取り込む"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:41
msgid "Discard changes"
msgstr "変更を破棄する"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:43
msgid ""
"When importing a GIF animation, you can adjust playback speed and other "
"parameters"
msgstr "GIF アニメーションを取り込む際、再生速度などのパラメータを調整できます"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:45
msgid "![1742136609404](image/background/1742136609404.png)"
msgstr "![1742136609404](image/background/1742136609404.png)"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:45
msgid "1742136609404"
msgstr "1742136609404"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:49
msgid "Frame rate adjustment (up to 30fps)"
msgstr "フレームレートの調整（最大 30fps）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:51
msgid "Note: Due to performance limitations, higher frame rates may cause lag"
msgstr "注: 性能上の理由で、フレームレートを高くしすぎると動作が重くなることがあります。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:53
msgid "Speed adjustment for GIF playback"
msgstr "GIF 再生速度の調整"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:54
msgid "GIF adjustment strategy:"
msgstr "GIF の調整方式:"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:55
msgid ""
"Drop frames: Excess keyframes will be discarded when adjusting frame rate"
msgstr "フレーム間引き: フレームレートを合わせるために、余分なコマを破棄します。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/background.md:56
msgid ""
"Extend frames: No frames will be discarded, but the final GIF playback "
"duration may be longer than expected"
msgstr "フレーム延長: コマを破棄せず、再生時間が想定より長くなる場合があります。"
